Package: local.duobar
Name: DuoBar
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: An iPhone Duo-inspired status bar for iOS 16.
 A circular battery ring with a live percentage, Wi-Fi strength and four cellular signal dots.
 Includes charging and Low Power Mode colors, light and dark styling, and an on/off switch in Settings.
 Developed by RBx9. Twitter: @RedaBuali.
Maintainer: RBx9
Author: RBx9
Homepage: https://twitter.com/RedaBuali
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 16.0), firmware (<< 17.0)
Tag: role::tweak
